A||||6||RossT||on a cold start, how long until she idles down?||||1||
Z||000000||RossT||10-31-2001||11:40 PM||||My 88 Formula had a high idle/glowing manifold and found a cracked egr tube.  Replaced it with the IRM tube. Now she idles nice and smooth around 950 when warmed up.  But, on a cold start she will fast idle around 1500, and this will not drop until the temp gage climbs about 1/4 of the way up, then she idles down.<P>On my low mileage 88gt, she idles down rather<BR>quickly on a cold start.<P>Thanks!||||reg||1
Z||000001||camon||11-01-2001||12:54 AM||||My 87 2.8 idles down after about 2-3 mins. As soon as the temp gauge starts to climb (about the first or second hash mark).<P>------------------<BR>Keith||||reg||1
